{"name":"FOG battle threads","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":25,"casual":{"lead":["A FOG battle is a recurring thread format on looksmax.org in which the original poster shows two people, usually women or fictional characters, and asks readers to pick which one \"fogs\" the other. Fogging is the forum's term for visually overpowering someone with a stronger face or frame.","The payoff for appearance-minded members is comparative: by arguing over why one face wins, users spell out the traits they consider decisive, such as bone structure, lower third, hair volume, height and frame, and use that vocabulary when judging their own look. The threads are informal polls; no research tests their rankings."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["Threads are usually themed: hair colour (blonde), region or phenotype labels (North Atlantid, Latina, Mediterranean), country matchups, a film or game cast, or mother versus daughter. The opening post may list each contender's strengths and weaknesses, or simply present two photos with a numbered choice, and replies vote and argue the case."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Threads rate real people's faces and bodies by label and often attract insulting banter, and members who post their own photos can receive harsh comments. Votes reflect the preferences of a self-selected forum audience."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Fog Battle of the Unfoggables - Hilary Rhoda vs Brooke Shields","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/fog-battle-of-the-unfoggables-hilary-rhoda-vs-brooke-shields.1404361/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250602210047/https://looksmax.org/threads/fog-battle-of-the-unfoggables-hilary-rhoda-vs-brooke-shields.1404361/"},{"title":"Mogs [Fog Battle] Albino vs Vantablack TeraStacy","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/fog-battle-albino-vs-vantablack-terastacy.500817/","site":"looksmax.org","