"},{"title":"Rizla Training And Transformation Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/rizla-training-and-transformation-log/250575","site":"T Nation · 198 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Court Ruling a Blow to Bush","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/court-ruling-a-blow-to-bush/108010","site":"T Nation · 194 posts · 2008"},{"title":"Is Old Europe Really This Impotent?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/is-old-europe-really-this-impotent/112623","site":"T Nation · 157 posts · 2008"},{"title":"famous movies fog battle 14","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/famous-movies-fog-battle-14.502819/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220602013503/https://looksmax.org/threads/famous-movies-fog-battle-14.502819/"},{"title":"brazilian mutt fog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/brazilian-mutt-fog-battle.491160/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220602013503/https://looksmax.org/threads/brazilian-mutt-fog-battle.491160/"},{"title":"colombia versus venezuela fog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/colombia-versus-venezuela-fog-battle.489770/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220602013503/https://looksmax.org/threads/colombia-versus-venezuela-fog-battle.489770/"},{"title":"gigastacy fog battle poll","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/gigastacy-fog-battle-poll.487001/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220421171707/https://looksmax.org/threads/gigastacy-fog-battle-poll.487001/"},{"title":"famous movies fog battle 12","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/famous-movies-fog-battle-12.480055/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220430225932/https://looksmax.org/threads/famous-movies-fog-battle-12.480055/"},{"title":"famous movies fog battle 11","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/famous-movies-fog-battle-11.476948/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220714015147/https://looksmax.org/threads/famous-movies-fog-battle-11.476948/"},{"title":"female fog battle sahar luna vs madison beer","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/female-fog-battle-sahar-luna-vs-madison-beer.463170/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220309022631/https://looksmax.org/threads/female-fog-battle-sahar-luna-vs-madison-beer.463170/"},{"title":"intercontinental stacy fog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/intercontinental-stacy-fog-battle.321226/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220621222735/https://looksmax.org/threads/intercontinental-stacy-fog-battle.321226/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Jawline & face shape","chain":["Two faces compared side by side","Members name the features that decide the vote","Readers learn which traits the community prizes and compare their own"],"effect":"claimed","text":"The threads give looksmaxxers concrete examples of which facial and body traits forum members rank highest. Participants use the feature-by-feature arguments as a reference when deciding what to improve in their own appearance."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["A FOG battle (also written \"fog battle\" or \"fog off\") is a themed comparison thread on looksmax.org in which two faces are presented and members vote on which one \"fogs\" the other. The term comes from the forum's use of fogging and mogging for out-competing someone visually; Wikipedia describes mogging as slang from incel and manosphere communities for asserting dominance over someone through appearance [1].","Titles show the range of formats: \"Fog Battle of the Unfoggables\" between two well-known models [2], matchups by hair colour [3], country-versus-country \"apex pheno\" threads [4][5][6], regional groupings such as Latina or Mestiza [7][8], and lighter themes such as video-game characters [1] or a mother against her daughter [9]. Some threads rate members' own appearance, such as \"org users as female true eve fog battle\" [10].","For people working on how they look, the threads serve as a shared language. Posts name features like frame, height, phenotype, bone structure, hair volume and texture, and facial width-to-height ratio as the reasons a face wins or loses [2]. Members use those same terms when assessing which traits to work on. No published research has examined these threads or validated their outcomes."],"infobox":[["Type","Forum comparison / voting thread"],["Where","looksmax.org"],["Format","Two contenders, themed matchup, vote in replies"],["Related terms","Fogging, mogging, true Eve face, phenotype"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["A typical post names a theme, shows two sets of photos and asks readers to choose. The simplest version lists two names and says to pick which one fogs, with members tagged to join in [11]. More elaborate posts give each contender a label such as \"True Eve Face\" or a regional phenotype, plus height, frame size and lists of strengths and weaknesses [2].","Another variant compares exaggerated opposites, for example an \"Albino vs Vantablack\" thread in which the reply chain digresses into the origin of the intensifier prefix \"tera\" (from the Greek for \"monster\") [12]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Themes","paras":["Region and phenotype threads compare countries or ethnic groupings under labels such as \"apex pheno\" [4][5][6], Latina and Mestiza matchups [7][8], and \"Asians vs whites\" [13]. Others cover hair colour with a face-only rule [3], a \"full package\" format that weighs more than the face [14], classic matchups between North Atlantid women [15], and pop-culture themes including Overwatch heroes [1]. A \"mom vs daughter\" thread frames inherited looks [9]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["Replies mix votes with feature analysis and with jokes. In one thread a reply praises a contender as a \"true Eve\" that \"fogs to oblivion\" [11], while another thread's replies compare two models by frame, hair and height against a taller, wider-framed woman seen on social media [2]. The wider looksmaxxing vocabulary, including mogging and the PSL rating scale, is covered in the encyclopedia article on the movement, which notes that parts of PSL are described as pseudoscientific [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Members treat fog battles as both entertainment and a way to calibrate what a top-tier face looks like [2].","claims":[{"claim":"Specific features, such as frame, bones, height and lower third, decide who \"fogs\"","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Fog Battle of the Unfoggables - Hilary Rhoda vs Brooke Shields","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/fog-battle-of-the-unfoggables-hilary-rhoda-vs-brooke-shields.1404361/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2024,"type":"forum"},{"title":"blonde fog battle face only","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/blonde-fog-battle-face-only.525492/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2021,"type":"forum"},{"title":"apex pheno fog battle colombia versus lithuania","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/apex-pheno-fog-battle-colombia-versus-lithuania.612177/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2022,"type":"forum"},{"title":"apex pheno fog battle portugal versus belarus","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/apex-pheno-fog-battle-portugal-versus-belarus.603710/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2022,"type":"forum"},{"title":"apex pheno fog battle brazil versus sweden","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/apex-pheno-fog-battle-brazil-versus-sweden.584597/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2022,"type":"forum"},{"title":"latina mestiza fog battle part 2","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/latina-mestiza-fog-battle-part-2.870802/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2023,"type":"for